## 🧠 FOLLOW-UPS PAGE PHILOSOPHY

This page answers **one brutal question**:

> “Who do I need to follow up with right now?”

Not history.
Not invoices.
**Action only.**

---

# 🧱 PAGE LAYOUT (DESKTOP)

```
┌──── Page Header ─────────────────────┐
│ Follow-ups        Today | Overdue    │
│ Subtitle: Invoices needing action   │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──── Quick Filters ───────────────────┐
│ Today ▾  Overdue ▾  Client ▾         │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘

┌──── Follow-up Action List ───────────┐
│ Follow-up rows                       │
└──────────────────────────────────────┘
```

This should feel like a **to-do list for money**.

---

# 1️⃣ PAGE HEADER

### Title:

**Follow-ups**

### Subtitle:

> “Invoices that need your attention”

No Add Invoice button here.
This page is about **clearing tasks**, not adding data.

---

# 2️⃣ QUICK FILTER TABS (KEY)

Default filter:

* **Today**

Other tabs:

* Overdue
* Upcoming (next 7 days)
* All

### Badges:

* Today (3)
* Overdue (8)

This creates urgency.

---

# 3️⃣ FOLLOW-UP ACTION LIST (CORE)

This is **not** a normal invoice table.

### Each row contains:

* Client Name (bold)
* Invoice # (small)
* Amount
* Due date + days overdue
* Last follow-up info
* **Primary Action Button**

---

### Example row layout:

```
ABC Pvt Ltd
Invoice #INV-1023 · ₹45,000
Due: 7 days ago
Last follow-up: WhatsApp · 3 days ago

[ Follow up now ]
```

Card-style rows > dense tables.

---

# 4️⃣ PRIMARY ACTION FLOW

Click **Follow up now** →

* Opens quick action modal:

  * Send email
  * Send WhatsApp
  * Mark as paid
  * Add note (“Client promised Friday”)

Fast. No page reload.

---

# 5️⃣ VISUAL PRIORITY (VERY IMPORTANT)

* Overdue rows → subtle red left border
* Due today → yellow accent
* Upcoming → neutral

No bright colors. Just guidance.

---

# 6️⃣ SORTING (AUTOMATIC, NOT USER-CONTROLLED)

Default sort:

1. Oldest overdue first
2. Highest amount next
3. Recent follow-ups last

Users shouldn’t think about sorting.

---

# 7️⃣ EMPTY STATES

### No follow-ups today 🎉

Text:

> “All caught up!
> No invoices need follow-up today.”

Small celebration emoji is okay 😄

---

# ❌ WHAT NOT TO PUT HERE

* Paid invoices
* Invoice upload
* Reminder rules
* Charts
* Client analytics

This page is a **strike zone**, not a report.

---

# 🧠 WHY THIS PAGE IS GOLD

* Converts data → action
* Reduces mental load
* Encourages daily habit
* Feels productive

Most invoice tools don’t have this page —
that’s your **differentiator**.

